{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a brand new “Inside Calm Nights” ingredient section from scratch.
    
    Section style
    Make the section feel clean, premium, airy, and easy to scan
    Use a white background
    Use soft Ariya purple accents
    The layout should feel spacious, not condensed or crowded
    Add generous spacing between cards, text, and section elements
    Keep the design minimal and elegant
    Section heading
    
    Inside Calm Nights
    
    Section subheading
    
    Every ingredient was chosen for a reason. No proprietary blends. No hidden doses.
    
    Desktop layout
    
    Build a desktop section that shows all 6 ingredients in a clean, spacious layout.
    
    Desktop structure
    Center the heading and subheading at the top
    Show 6 ingredients total
    Use a 3-column, 2-row layout
    Make each ingredient block large enough to breathe
    Do not make the cards too narrow
    Leave enough white space around everything
    Desktop ingredient card style
    
    Each ingredient item should include:
    
    a floating ingredient image
    ingredient name
    short supporting description
    a small purple category pill above the ingredient name
    
    The ingredient image should look like it is floating on white, not boxed in tightly.
    
    Use:
    
    white cards or white content blocks
    rounded corners
    very subtle shadow or very light purple border
    clean typography
    generous internal padding
    Mobile layout
    
    Build a mobile version that feels open and roomy.
    
    Mobile structure
    Use a horizontal carousel
    Create 3 slides total
    Put 2 ingredients per slide
    Each slide should have 2 long horizontal cards stacked vertically
    The cards should be wide and roomy, not short or cramped
    Each card should stretch across most of the screen width
    Add pagination dots under the cards
    Make the mobile version feel spacious and easy to swipe
    Mobile ingredient card style
    
    Each mobile card should include:
    
    floating ingredient image on the left
    text content on the right
    white background
    rounded corners
    subtle shadow or light purple outline
    generous padding
    enough height so the text does not feel cramped
    Ingredients to include
    
    Use these 6 ingredients only:
    
    1. L-Theanine
    
    Category pill: Calm Mind
    Description: Supports relaxation and helps quiet racing thoughts before bed.
    
    2. Lemon Balm Extract
    
    Category pill: Stress Relief
    Description: Traditional botanical used to promote calmness and support relaxation.
    
    3. Chamomile Extract
    
    Category pill: Relaxation
    Description: Well-known herbal extract traditionally used to support restful sleep.
    
    4. Magnolia Bark Extract
    
    Category pill: Deep Calm
    Description: Supports relaxation and helps ease mental tension before bed.
    
    5. L-Tryptophan
    
    Category pill: Sleep Support
    Description: Amino acid that helps support your body’s natural melatonin and serotonin production.
    
    6. Tart Cherry Extract
    
    Category pill: Sleep Quality
    Description: Supports healthy sleep quality and nighttime recovery.
    
    Mobile slide order
    Slide 1
    L-Theanine
    Lemon Balm Extract
    Slide 2
    Chamomile Extract
    Magnolia Bark Extract
    Slide 3
    L-Tryptophan
    Tart Cherry Extract
    Important instructions
    Build this section from scratch
    Keep the background white
    Make the layout feel open and not condensed
    The ingredient images must load properly and be clearly visible
    Keep the floating ingredient look
    Make the mobile cards longer and roomier than the current version
    Prioritize clean spacing and readability, make the ingredient boxes longer horizontally not vertically for the mobile version, for the mobile version give an arrow option to go back and forth on the slides 
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-ingredients-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    background-color: #ffffff;
    padding: 80px 20px;
  }

  .ai-ingredients-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ai-ingredients-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 60px;
  }

  .ai-ingredients-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    margin: 0 0 16px 0;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .ai-ingredients-subheading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.subheading_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.subheading_color }};
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 700px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .ai-ingredients-desktop-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: {{ block.settings.card_spacing }}px;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .ai-ingredients-mobile-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: none;
  }

  .ai-ingredient-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: #ffffff;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_border_radius }}px;
    padding: {{ block.settings.card_padding }}px;
    {% if block.settings.card_style == 'shadow' %}
      box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(60, 14, 102, 0.08);
    {% elsif block.settings.card_style == 'border' %}
      border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.card_border_color }};
    {% endif %}
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-ingredient-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
  }

  .ai-ingredient-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: {{ block.settings.image_size }}px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .ai-ingredient-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
    border-radius: 8px;
  }

  .ai-ingredient-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    background-color: #f9f6ff;
    border-radius: 8px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .ai-ingredient-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 60%;
    height: 60%;
    opacity: 0.3;
  }

  .ai-ingredient-category-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-block;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.pill_background_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.pill_text_color }};
    padding: 6px 16px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.pill_font_size }}px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .ai-ingredient-name-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.ingredient_name_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.ingredient_name_color }};
    margin: 0 0 12px 0;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .ai-ingredient-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.description_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.description_color }};
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-carousel-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .ai-carousel-track-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    transition: transform 0.4s ease;
  }

  .ai-carousel-slide-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    min-width: 100%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
    padding: 0 10px;
  }

  .ai-ingredient-card-mobile-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: #ffffff;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_border_radius }}px;
    padding: 28px;
    {% if block.settings.card_style == 'shadow' %}
      box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(60, 14, 102, 0.08);
    {% elsif block.settings.card_style == 'border' %}
      border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.card_border_color }};
    {% endif %}
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 24px;
    min-height: 160px;
  }

  .ai-ingredient-image-mobile-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 110px;
    height: 110px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    border-radius: 8px;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .ai-ingredient-placeholder-mobile-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 110px;
    height: 110px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    background-color: #f9f6ff;
    border-radius: 8px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .ai-ingredient-placeholder-mobile-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 60%;
    height: 60%;
    opacity: 0.3;
  }

  .ai-ingredient-content-mobile-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex: 1;
    text-align: left;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .ai-carousel-controls-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-top: 24px;
  }

  .ai-carousel-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.arrow_background_color }};
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.arrow_border_color }};
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .ai-carousel-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }}:disabled {
    opacity: 0.3;
    cursor: not-allowed;
  }

  .ai-carousel-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }}:not(:disabled):hover {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.arrow_hover_background_color }};
    border-color: {{ block.settings.arrow_hover_border_color }};
  }

  .ai-carousel-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    stroke: {{ block.settings.arrow_color }};
    stroke-width: 2;
  }

  .ai-carousel-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }}:not(:disabled):hover svg {
    stroke: {{ block.settings.arrow_hover_color }};
  }

  .ai-carousel-dots-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .ai-carousel-dot-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.dot_inactive_color }};
    border: none;
    padding: 0;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-carousel-dot-{{ ai_gen_id }}.active {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.dot_active_color }};
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-ingredients-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 60px 20px;
    }

    .ai-ingredients-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    .ai-ingredients-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size | times: 0.7 }}px;
    }

    .ai-ingredients-subheading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.subheading_size | times: 0.9 }}px;
    }

    .ai-ingredients-desktop-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      display: none;
    }

    .ai-ingredients-mobile-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      display: block;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

